They have been modified for this demo: the plugins were renamed to the
`demo/sdlc-*` set, the plan-output path convention was genericised, and
references to the upstream project name were removed from prose. Most skill
instructions are substantially the upstream content. The exceptions are the
descriptions changed in step 00, and `test-driven-development`, whose body
was rewritten in step 02.

Some upstream material is kept unchanged inside the skills, although no step
uses it: the `test-pressure-*.md`, `test-academic.md` and `CREATION-LOG.md`
files and the `references/` examples under `systematic-debugging`. They are
upstream's own tests and notes for that skill, and may refer to upstream
projects and paths.

